ir large size and good taste and are also used to extract edible oil">These seeds are popular as a snack due to their large size and good taste and are also used to extract edible oil</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_83" data-source="" data-orig="rich in unsaturated fatty acids that are beneficial for health">rich in unsaturated fatty acids that are beneficial for health</span>.</p><p><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_84" data-source="" data-orig="Oil seed type">Oil seed type</span>:</strong> <span class ="tr_" id="tr_85" data-source="" data-orig="These seeds are smaller">These seeds are smaller</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_86" data-source="" data-orig="plump">plump</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_87" data-source="" data-orig="with thin shells">with thin shells</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_88" data-source="" data-orig="and have a high kernel content of">and have a high kernel content of</span> 65-75%, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_89" data-source="" data-orig="with an oil content of">with an oil content of</span> 45-60%. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_90" data-source="" data-orig="The shells are usually black or striped gray">The shells are usually black or striped gray</span>, Ideal zur Ölgewinnung. Zum Beispiel, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_91" data-source="" data-orig="the variety Longkui Z9 is an early-maturing oil seed hybrid with a growing period of about">the variety Longkui Z9 is an early-maturing oil seed hybrid with a growing period of about</span> 104 Tage. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_92" data-source="" data-orig="It has an oil content of">It has an oil content of</span> 42.97% <span class ="tr_" id="tr_93" data-source="" data-orig="and a kernel rate of">and a kernel rate of</span> 74.6%.</p><p><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_94" data-source="" data-orig="Dual-purpose type">Dual-purpose type</span>:</strong> <span class ="tr_" id="tr_95" data-source="" data-orig="These sunflower seeds can be both eaten and used for oil extraction">These sunflower seeds c